                      <run bold='true' fontcolor='#77002c'>Time Based Condition, Travel Time, Fleet Delay, MOV- Travel Time, MOV- Fleet Delay, Basket Value, Service Fee, Small Order Fee and Customer Condition (0 DF for New Customers) </run>
